  "title": "Legend Biotech Establishes Clinical Proof-of-Concept for LB2501, a Potential First-in-Class In Vivo CD19/CD20 Dual-Targeting CAR-T, in Relapsed/Refractory B-Cell Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma",
  "summary": "Achieved 100% ORR and 83.3% CR rate at dose level 2 following a single infusion in patients with relapsed/refractory B-NHL in an ongoing Phase 1 study Single infusion of LB2501 generated dose-dependent in vivo CAR-T expansion without lymphodepletion No dose-limiting toxicities, serious adverse",
